    {
      "id": 264498,
      "name": "",
      "username": "LonelyMan",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:30:41.041Z",
      "cooked": "<p>RIP Prime War.</p>\n<p>It’s very fitting that Scions like pasta, because they wish to devour the Flying Spaghetti Monster.</p>\n<p>Dawn Clo’hen.  Not related to Leonard LeCluck at all.</p>\n<p>Surprising that Warden Giggles didn’t guess the double and triple crosses of Voss and Blade, since back in the speculation era, there was a LOT of talk about Doctor Doom stealing the power of Galactus from the Silver Surfer, and it was fairly obvious that Baron Blade at least was the equivalent character for a twist like that.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2025-11-24T19:28:48.095Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 5,
