      "raw": "RIP Prime War.\n\nIt's very fitting that Scions like pasta, because they wish to devour the Flying Spaghetti Monster.\n\nDawn Clo'hen.  Not related to Leonard LeCluck at all.\n\nSurprising that Warden Giggles didn't guess the double and triple crosses of Voss and Blade, since back in the speculation era, there was a LOT of talk about Doctor Doom stealing the power of Galactus from the Silver Surfer, and it was fairly obvious that Baron Blade at least was the equivalent character for a twist like that.",
